title: Constitutional Reforms
subtitle: Our trademark reforms are to be decided now...
view-if: year = 1931 and month = 3 and spd_in_government = 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true
face-image: img/All_Quiet.jpg
go-to: constitute

@constitute

= Constitutional Reforms

We will now decide our Amendments for the constitution.


@constitute_menu

- @threshold: Reduce the electoral threshold to 5%.
- @nothreshold: Remove the amendment from the threshold.

@threshold
view-if: threshold_reform <= 0
on-arrival: threshold_reform = 1; reform_number += 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@nothreshold
view-if: threshold_reform >= 1
on-arrival: threshold_reform = 0; reform_number -= 1;
go-to: constitute_menu


- @end_amendments: Finish the draft of the constitution.

@end_amendments

We have finalized the draft for our constitution.
